  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Thread shrimp onto skewers, leaving a small space between each shrimp.",
    "3. Brush skewers with olive oil and season with salt, black pepper, cumin, and coriander.",
    "4. Grill skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until pink and cooked through.",
    "5. Meanwhile, combine diced avocado, red onion, and lime juice in a bowl.",
    "6. Serve grilled shrimp skewers with avocado salsa.",
    "7. Garnish with cilantro, if desired."
